{"id":"en_she-kissed-me-off-camera","title":"She Kissed Me Off Camera","titleEn":"She Kissed Me Off Camera","description":"Maya’s discovery of her girlfriend’s infidelity, made just before a live audition, leaves her paralyzed during an intimacy scene. Helena, a renowned director, steps in to coach her through the art of an on-camera kiss. Though Maya lands the part, she is quietly pursuing the truth behind her sister’s fatal accident. The woman who has stirred both the investigation and her own longings leaves her wondering whether trust is possible.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/she-kissed-me-off-camera/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/she-kissed-me-off-camera/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Hate to Love","Karma Payback","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dexvk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_she-kissed-me-off-camera_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dexvk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_she-kissed-me-off-camera_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dexvk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_she-kissed-me-off-camera_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dexvk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_she-kissed-me-off-camera_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dexvk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_she-kissed-me-off-camera_5","title":"Ep